cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pySTREAM, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pySTREAM: an energy scenario modelling tool"
abstract: >-
  pySTREAM is a Python version of the Excel energy system model STREAM
  (https://www.esymodels.man.dtu.dk/stream), with a
  desktop window for building energy scenarios and comparing their energy
  balance, CO2 emissions, costs and hourly electricity time series with a base
  year. It was created as a Bachelor's thesis project at the Technical
  University of Denmark (DTU) in 2023.
authors:
  - family-names: Hoielt
    given-names: Ida Cecilie
    affiliation: Technical University of Denmark (DTU)
license: MIT
keywords:
  - energy system model
  - energy scenarios
  - STREAM
  - Python
